OL,3,ATory ex-ministers face serious
OL,4,Aquestions over migrant centre chaos,
OL,5,Ainquiry hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn overcrowded migrant reception
OL,8,Fcentre, where a man died, raises "very
OL,9,Fserious questions" for ministers in the
OL,10,Fformer Conservative government,
OL,11,Fincluding two home secretaries and
OL,12,Fformer prime ministers, an inquiry has
OL,13,Fheard.
OL,15,FThe Manston centre in Kent became
OL,16,Foverwhelmed in November 2022 at the
OL,17,Fheight of the small boats crisis, with
OL,18,Faround 4,000 people held there.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
