OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATory ex-ministers face serious
OL,4,Aquestions over migrant centre chaos,
OL,5,Ainquiry hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FHome Office officials knew conditions
OL,8,Fwere unlawful and children were at risk
OL,9,Fof harm, but had no alternative plan
OL,10,Ffor where to accommodate them, the
OL,11,Finquiry heard on Friday.
OL,13,FFormer Home Secretaries Dame Priti
OL,14,FPatel and Suella Braverman shared in
OL,15,Fpreliminary evidence that Number 10 was
OL,16,Finvolved in decisions made at the time.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
